<div class="wrap page-head">
  <p class="eyebrow">Admissions</p>
  <h1>Four steps, no fuss</h1>
  <p class="lede">Choosing where your child spends their days is a big decision. The process for making it should not be. Here is the whole thing.</p>
</div>

<section class="band--paper">
  <div class="wrap">
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><div><strong>Say hello</strong><p>Fill in the short form on the <a href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}">contact page</a>, or call. Tell us your child's age and what you are looking for. We reply with the practical things: programs, calendar, fees.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Visit</strong><p>Come to the campus, meet the teachers, see a class in action. If you are not in Hội An yet, we do this on a video call. We will also chat with your child to understand how they learn and where their English is.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Forms</strong><p>When you are ready, we send the enrollment forms. They gather what we need to get your child's first day right.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Payment and welcome</strong><p>Pay the enrollment fee to hold the place. You get a welcome packet with everything for day one, and we get to add a name to a class list.</p></div></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

